/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 44 0 R
/T (manage the entry, exit, and availability of vehicles in a parking area without requiring continuous manual supervision. The system uses counters to keep track of the number of vehicles inside the parking area and a Finite State Machine \(FSM\) to control the different operating states of the parking system.)
/E (manage the entry, exit, and availability of vehicles in a parking area without requiring continuous manual supervision. The system uses counters to keep track of the number of vehicles inside the parking area and a Finite State Machine \(FSM\) to control the different operating states of the parking system.)
