/E (The proposed system uses sensors to detect vehicles at the entrance and exit. The counter increases when a vehicle enters and decreases when a vehicle leaves. The FSM controls the sequence of operations, such as waiting for a vehicle, detecting entry, checking availability, opening the gate,and closing the gate.)
