459 0 obj
<<
/Title (manage the entry, exit, and availability of vehicles in a parking area without requiring continuous manual supervision. The system uses counters to keep track of the number of vehicles inside the parking area and a Finite State Machine \(FSM\) to control the different operating states of the parking system.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 192 0 R
/Prev 299 0 R
/Next 460 0 R
>>
endobj
460 0 obj
<<
/Title (In a conventional parking system, security personnel may have to manually count vehicles and check whether parking spaces are available. This can result in errors, delays, and inefficient use of parking space. A digital automatic parking system can solve these problems by continuously monitoring vehicle entry and exit.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 192 0 R
/Prev 459 0 R
/Next 300 0 R
